Wanted across the galaxy, the **Cat Burglar** will gladly stroll off
with your valuables, her feline alien heritage making her nimble and
stealthy. Just never call her a cat to her face, or you could lose
more than your belongings. *Agile +2, Art of Invisibility +2, Attack
(Claws) +1, Dexterous +2, Quick +2; Greedy -2, Sensitivity (Being
Called a Cat) -2, Wanted (GPL) -3.*

